---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Cuenta Suspendida — Gamio 🚫">
  <section class="ban-page">
    <div class="ban-orb ban-orb-1"></div>
    <div class="ban-orb ban-orb-2"></div>
    <div class="ban-grid-bg"></div>

    <div class="ban-container animate-fade-in-up">
      <div class="ban-card">
        <div class="ban-icon">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        
        <h1>Acceso Suspendido</h1>
        <div class="ban-divider"></div>
        
        <p class="warning-text">
          Tu cuenta en <strong>Gamio</strong> ha sido suspendida permanentemente por violar nuestros términos de servicio y políticas de conducta en la comunidad.
        </p>

        <div class="ban-reasons">
          <h3>Infracciones de Conducta Comunes:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>🚫 Lenguaje ofensivo, acoso o toxicidad en el chat global o privado.</li>
            <li>🚫 Comportamientos antideportivos o trampas en partidas organizadas.</li>
            <li>🚫 Publicación de spam, publicidad molesta o links maliciosos.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <p class="appeal-text">
          Si crees que esto se trata de un error o deseas apelar la sanción, puedes ponerte en contacto con nuestro equipo de soporte técnico enviando un correo a <a href="mailto:soporte@gamio.com">soporte@gamio.com</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="ban-actions">
          <a href="/api/auth/signout" class="btn-primary ban-btn">Cerrar Sesión</a>
          <a href="/contacto" class="skip-link">Contactar Soporte</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .ban-page {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 120px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ban-orb {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(120px);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ban-orb-1 {
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12); /* Red warning glow */
    top: -150px;
    right: -150px;
  }

  .ban-orb-2 {
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.08);
    bottom: -100px;
    left: -100px;
  }

  .ban-grid-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.01) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.01) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ban-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ban-card {
    background: rgba(15, 20, 31, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(30px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(30px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25); /* Crimson red border */
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 30px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.05);
  }

  .ban-icon {
    width: 70px;
    height: 70px;
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
    border: 2px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #f87171;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
    animation: pulseRed 2s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulseRed {
    0% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); }
    50% { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4); }
    100% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); }
  }

  .ban-card h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: white;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .ban-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3), transparent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .warning-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ban-reasons {
    background: rgba(11, 15, 26, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ban-reasons h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #f87171;
  }

  .ban-reasons ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .ban-reasons li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .appeal-text {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .appeal-text a {
    color: #f87171;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .appeal-text a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .ban-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .ban-btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    background: #ef4444;
    border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
  }

  .ban-btn:hover {
    background: #dc2626;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
  }

  .skip-link {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .skip-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ban-card {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
